{"event":"scene_trace","kind":"dialogue","scene":"d01p01_g3","sequence":56,"pointer":"0x084D42C4","speaker":"butterfree","text":"Mon bébé est sain et\nsauf...[pause=30] Je ne sais comment vous\nremercier...","detail":"","music":"PMD Red - A Successful Rescue.ogg"}
